            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This review considers the problem of pain chronification process based on the biopsychosocial model. Treatment of nonspecific low-back pain is specifically highlighted. Algorithms for the management of such patients are described. The efficacy and safety of nimesulide is discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
